{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-147",
  "title": "Plugin Migration",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Plugin Migration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**CONTENT & PRESENTATION**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**KeyDesign Addon & WPBakery Page Builder** → **LET GO OF**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "These are WordPress-specific tools. Webflow has a built-in visual builder, so no external plugin is needed."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Slider Revolution** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If the current site has advanced sliders, Webflow has built-in slider components, or you could use a third-party JavaScript library like [Swiper.js](https://swiperjs.com/)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Typing Effect** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow supports CSS animations and interactions. If the effect is more complex, you can use custom JavaScript like [Typed.js](https://mattboldt.com/demos/typed-js/)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ClassyPress PRO by Mittun** → **LET GO OF**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is a WordPress theme, so it’s not transferable. Webflow allows for full custom design, so you’ll rebuild the look from scratch."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Question about GiveSmart**: If GiveSmart requires a plugin, check if it has an embeddable widget for Webflow."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**EVENTS & COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Blocks for Eventbrite** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow does not have a built-in Eventbrite integration, but you can use:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Eventbrite Embed**: Use an iframe to embed Eventbrite event pages."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Zapier Integration**: Automate event listing updates in Webflow."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Webflow CMS**: Manually list events and link to Eventbrite for registration."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Contact Form 7 & WP Forms** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow has a built-in **Forms** feature. For advanced forms:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use **Formstack, Typeform, or Jotform** and embed them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use **Zapier** to connect forms to Webflow CMS or other CRMs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Popup Maker** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow allows for pop-ups through native **interactions and animations**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If pop-ups require conditions (e.g., based on user input), use **ConvertFlow or Elfsight Popup**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**WP-FormAssembly** → **KEEP (IF SALESFORCE INTEGRATION IS NEEDED)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If forms are integrating with Salesforce, check if Webflow's form system meets needs."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Alternative: Embed **FormAssembly forms** in Webflow or use Zapier."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**MEMBERSHIP & E-COMMERCE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**MemberPress Basic** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow does not have built-in membership functionality. Consider:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **MemberStack**: Best for simple membership with Webflow-native UI."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Outseta**: If email, CRM, and payment processing are needed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **MemberSpace**: If simple content gating is enough."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**WooCommerce** → **REPLACE (IF NEEDED)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow **does** support e-commerce, but it's not as robust as WooCommerce."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Options**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use Webflow’s e-commerce if selling a few digital/physical items."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use **Shopify Buy Button** or **Snipcart** if more complex checkout needed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Do we need this AND Eventbrite?** – If Eventbrite handles event sales, WooCommerce might not be needed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**MEDIA & CONTENT ENHANCEMENT**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**EmbedPress** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow **natively** supports YouTube, Vimeo, Google Docs, and other embeds."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Smush (Image Optimization)** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow **automatically optimizes images** on upload."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Further optimization: **Use TinyPNG or ImageOptim before upload.**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**WP Extra File Types** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow supports common file types but has limits. If additional file types are needed:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use **Google Drive, Dropbox, or AWS S3 for storage** and link to files."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**NAVIGATION & STRUCTURE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Breadcrumb NavXT** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow does not have built-in breadcrumbs."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Solution: Use **Webflow CMS to create breadcrumb navigation** manually."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Redux Framework** → **LET GO OF**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-72",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This was for WordPress theme settings. Webflow **does not need this** since branding and styles are set visually."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**PERFORMANCE & TECHNICAL**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Redis Object Cache & WP Super Cache** → **LET GO OF**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-77",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow **has built-in CDN and caching**, so no external plugin is needed."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**WP-Optimize** → **LET GO OF**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-80",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow **optimizes performance automatically**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**UpdraftPlus (Backups)** → **KEEP (ALTERNATIVE NEEDED)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-83",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow **does not** have an automatic backup system like WordPress."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-84",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Options:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Manually **duplicate projects** in Webflow."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use **Webflow Backup feature** (limited but useful)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- For full data backup, **export collections as CSV regularly**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ANALYTICS & MARKETING**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Google Analytics by MonsterInsights** → **REPLACE**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-92",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow does not need a plugin. Just **add the GA tracking ID in Webflow settings**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Envato Market** → **LET GO OF**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-95",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This was for theme/plugin updates in WordPress, not needed in Webflow."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}